graph TD
    A([📩 Start: Auto-Notification Received
Advisee Petition Routed by System]) --> B[(ERP DB: Fetch Advisee Profile:
GPA, Credits, Academic Standing)]
    B --> C[Review Student's
Full Academic Record]
    C --> D[(ERP DB: Fetch Petition Details
& Instructor Decision if Available)]
    D --> E[Review Petition Type,
Reason & Instructor Comments]
    E --> F{Petition
Type}
    F -- Prerequisite Override --> G[Evaluate Readiness:
Grades in Related Courses]
    F -- Course Overload --> H[Evaluate Capacity:
Current Load, Past Performance]
    F -- Other Academic --> I[Evaluate Based on
Institutional Guidelines]
    G --> J{Academic Advisor
Recommendation}
    H --> J
    I --> J
    J -- Approve with Guidance --> K[Draft Academic Guidance Note
for Student Record]
    K --> L[(ERP DB: Log Approval +
Guidance Note)]
    L --> M[Notify Student:
Petition Approved by Advisor]
    J -- Reject --> N[Document Reason
for Rejection]
    N --> O[(ERP DB: Log Rejection
& Close Petition)]
    O --> P[Notify Student:
Petition Rejected — Reason Provided]
    J -- Escalate to Chair --> Q[(ERP DB: Escalate Petition
to Department Chair)]
    Q --> R[Notify Student & Chair:
Petition Under Escalated Review]
    M --> S([✅ End: Advisor Action Logged])
    P --> S
    R --> S